> Is there a way to change the default session on the CDE login?  I would
> like to change the default from dtsession, to the traditional dxsession
> (as with XDM).  This is currently possible with a menu selection on the
> login screen, but I would like to make it the default choice.
> 
> I have looked at a few resource strings, but have not found one that
> mimics the effect of choosing "dxsession" from the login screen. Any
> ideas?
> 
