[ Robert Graeb ]

>>  From time to time a process (it seems that it is randomly
>>  chosen) suddenly begins to use more and more cpu time.
>>  The 'top' utility shows a cpu usage of this process of
>>  nearly 200 %. When this happens of course it is is
