In article <3406E3CA.E9521FD3@tiac.net>,
Jeff Dickens  <twinkie@tiac.net> wrote:
>You might just need to apply the fix again...
>
>The problem had something to do with the format of
>shared libraries changing.

No, it has to do with the way X11R6 does things vs. X11R5.  R5 used
the select call to do event handling, and Netscape depends on that
to run the applets.  R6 uses poll to do event handling, which prevents
Netscape from running applets.


