Hi,

For a TLZ07 Dat Tape Drive:

	/dev/rmt?h or /dev/rmt?m -> Commpression mode
	/dev/rmt?l or /dev/rmt?a -> Non-Compression mode

The Size of the tape 60m,90m,120m determines how much you can squeeze
on the tape:

For Non-Compression:

	60m  -> 1.3GB
	90m  -> 2.0GB
	120m -> 4.0GB

For Compression:

	Double the above figures - but be cautious - it depends on the
	data you are compression.


