Yon Han Chong wrote:
> 
> How can I display $PWD on xterm prompt?
> 
This is a part of the xterm man page (As usual: RTFM first)

setenv CMD_ENV bsd
alias cwdcmd '/bin/echo -n "\033]2;${HOST}:$cwd\a\033]1;${HOST}\a"'

Put these lines somewhere in your .cshrc (or whatever you might have)
file.
This shows the host:directory in the title and the host in the icon.

Good luck,

Torsten Hehl.



