Java applets work fine for me on V4.0B with the fixed up libXt.so.  What is
the
checksum of the libXt.so you are using.  The one that works for me is

11490    600 /usr/local/lib/netscape4/libXt.so

with the following script to get things going.

Sean

$ cat $HOME/bin/netscape
#!/bin/sh

umask 077

cd $HOME

MOZILLA_HOME=/usr/local/lib/netscape4; export MOZILLA_HOME
XAPPLRESDIR=$MOZILLA_HOME; export XAPPLRESDIR
LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$MOZILLA_HOME; export LD_LIBRARY_PATH

PATH=$MOZILLA_HOME:$PATH; export PATH

exec netscape $@



